    "updated_at": "2021-08-06T17:01:00Z",
    "body": "This is even more apparent with this custom module:\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n[custom.env]\r\ncommand = \"pwd\"\r\nshell = [\"C:/msys64/usr/bin/sh.exe\"]\r\nwhen = \"true\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nthis always seems to output my home directory on the actual prompt, but works as expected (shows current dir) when I run `starship prompt` myself.",
